# Credentials for `c2 decompile`.
# Copy this file to `.env` (in the project root) and fill in the keys
# for the provider(s) you want to use.  `.env` is in `.gitignore` so
# your secrets stay local.
#
# Pydantic-AI reads these env vars natively via its provider classes —
# we do NOT parse or proxy them ourselves.  Pick one (or several) of:

# DeepSeek — the project default.  Used for `--model deepseek:*` (e.g.
# `deepseek:deepseek-v4-pro`, `deepseek:deepseek-v4-flash`).
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...

# OpenAI — used for `--model openai:*` (e.g. `openai:gpt-5`).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Anthropic — used for `--model anthropic:*`.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Google — used for `--model google:*`.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=...
